# src/media/ and public/media/ ARE committed. They hold real captures of the
# application: the Marketplace shot from scripts/capture-shots.mjs, and the
# screenshots and video of real runs, supplied by hand. src/lib/media.ts says
# what each one must show, and verify-site.mjs refuses to publish a page with
# a slot still empty.
